        <tr><td>Can it change text?</td><td>For narrow, deterministic edits that can be inspected.</td><td>Usually report first; only a subset of findings may have a safe fix.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Needs author judgment?</td><td>Not for simple syntax spacing and final-newline normalization.</td><td>Often, especially for headings, images, links, and code labels.</td></tr>
