  <p>Use an <strong>online Markdown formatter</strong> to make predictable syntax consistent. Use a <strong>Markdown linter</strong> to surface questions that deserve your attention. Use both when you want cleaner source, a more readable document, and control over the decisions that affect meaning.</p>
